## ROLE
You are a senior full-stack engineer and UI/UX designer. Build a production-quality, responsive **companion website** for **MOTOSYNQ AI**, an existing Android application (Kotlin + Jetpack Compose) that records motorcycle audio plus accelerometer and gyroscope data during controlled, stationary inspections. The Android app stays the primary data-collection product. The website is a companion dashboard that shows the same user's synced data and analysis results.

**Project title:** MOTOSYNQ AI: Intelligent Motorcycle Condition Monitoring Through Multimodal Sensor Fusion
**Positioning:** An AI-assisted screening tool. It does NOT replace a qualified mechanic, and no result is a confirmed mechanical diagnosis.

