## API CONTRACT (FastAPI, prefix `/api/v1`, JSON, bearer JWT from Supabase)
Server verifies the JWT (Supabase JWKS / JWT secret from env) on every request and **re-checks ownership** in code, in addition to RLS. Use the service role only inside the API, never in the frontend.

| Method & path | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `POST /vehicles` | Create vehicle |
| `GET /vehicles` | List own vehicles |
| `GET /vehicles/{id}/health-history` | Chronological results for a vehicle |
| `POST /sessions` | Create session (accepts `client_session_id` for idempotency; returns existing session if repeated) |
| `GET /sessions` | List, with filters `vehicle_id`, `from`, `to`, `status`, `result_category`, pagination |
| `GET /sessions/{id}` | Session with recordings and latest analysis |
| `POST /sessions/{id}/audio` | Multipart WAV upload; supports `Idempotency-Key` and `X-Content-SHA256` |
| `POST /sessions/{id}/sensor-data` | Multipart accelerometer/gyroscope CSV upload |
| `POST /sessions/{id}/analyze` | Start analysis; returns `202` + `analysis_id` |
| `GET /analysis/{analysis_id}` | Poll status/result |
| `GET /health` | Liveness, plus whether a model is loaded (`model_loaded: bool`) |

Document in `docs/API.md` with request/response JSON examples, error format and status codes. Standard error body:
```json
{ "error": { "code": "INVALID_AUDIO_FORMAT", "message": "Only 16-bit PCM WAV files are supported.", "request_id": "..." } }
```
Never return stack traces. Codes should include: `UNAUTHENTICATED`, `FORBIDDEN`, `NOT_FOUND`, `FILE_TOO_LARGE`, `INVALID_AUDIO_FORMAT`, `INVALID_SENSOR_CSV`, `DURATION_OUT_OF_RANGE`, `SESSION_MISMATCH`, `MODEL_NOT_CONFIGURED`, `ANALYSIS_FAILED`, `RATE_LIMITED`.

Analysis response example when no model is configured:
```json
{
  "analysis_id": "…", "status": "unavailable",
  "result_category": "model_not_configured",
  "message": "AI model not configured. Features and visualizations are available; no prediction was made.",
  "model": null, "supported_classes": []
}
```
Completed example includes: `result_category`, `confidence`, `uncertainty`, `model {name, version, trained_on, evaluated_on}`, `supported_classes`, `feature_summary`, `quality_observations`, `recommendation`, `timestamps`.

**Reliability and security:** file-size limits (audio 50 MB, CSV 20 MB, configurable), magic-byte validation, filename sanitization, path-traversal protection, content-type checks, rate limiting, request timeouts, CORS restricted to configured origins, structured logging without sensitive data, retry-safe uploads (idempotency keys + SHA-256 verification + resumable "re-upload if hash mismatch" behavior), and consistent error handling.

